-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Rainbow Islands
  Publisher   Ocean, 1990
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Rainbow Islands - The Story of Bubble Bobble 2
              (1990)(Ocean)(128K)[a][a].z80
  MD5         4c98b980b1726af545fccc99665ef29b

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  file: anything else is refused, with a message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Note        Dean Woodyatt's build with a sky palette fix: the dim-blue
              squares round objects against the bright sky are brightened on
              islands 1 and 4-7. Islands 2 and 3 use dim blue on purpose and
              are left alone.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Immune except to water
   3  Press P for next level

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

